          "settings": {
            "html": "<section class=\"notify-section\" id=\"notify\">\n  <p class=\"section-label\">Early access</p>\n  <h2>Be the first<br><em>on the water.</em></h2>\n  <p class=\"notify-desc\">Sessions fill quickly and we don't reopen waitlists. Join below and you'll hear about dates before anyone else \u2014 no spam, no hard sell. Just an invitation when the time is right.</p>\n  <div class=\"metform-notify-wrap\">\n    [metform slug=\"stillness-newsletter\"]\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"form-note\">One email when early access opens. That's it.</p>\n</section>\n\n<script>\nvar observer=new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){\n  entries.forEach(function(e){\n    if(e.isIntersecting){e.target.style.opacity='1';e.target.style.transform='translateY(0)'}\n  })\n},{threshold:0.08});\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.pillar,.session-card,.stat-item,.bowls-text').forEach(function(el){\n  el.style.opacity='0';el.style.transform='translateY(18px)';\n  el.style.transition='opacity 0.75s ease, transform 0.75s ease';\n  observer.observe(el);\n});\n</script>\n\n<style>\n:root {\n  --stone:#0E1B30;--midnight:#1D3152;--seafoam:#688F9D;\n  --wave:#A4B2BA;--breeze:#D9E8EB;--sand:#C4BBB4;--cream:#F7F0EC;\n}\n\n.notify-section {\n  background: rgba(29, 49, 82, 0.4) !important;\n  padding: 9rem 4rem !important;\n  border-top: 0.5px solid rgba(104, 143, 157, 0.15) !important;\n  text-align: center !important;\n}\n\n.notify-section h2 {\n  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif !important;\n  font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 4rem) !important;\n  font-weight: 300 !important;\n  color: var(--cream) !important;\n  margin-bottom: 1.25rem !important;\n  line-height: 1.1 !important;\n}\n\n.notify-section h2 em {\n  font-style: italic !important;\n  color: var(--wave) !important;\n}\n\n.notify-desc {\n  font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif !important;\n  font-size: 0.93rem !important;\n  color: var(--wave) !important;\n  max-width: 440px !important;\n  margin: 0 auto 3rem !important;\n  line-height: 1.85 !important;\n}\n\n.metform-notify-wrap form > *, .metform-notify-wrap .mf-form > * {\n  margin: 0 !important;\n  padding: 0 !important;\n  flex: none !important;\n  width: auto !important;\n}\n\n.metform-notify-wrap label, .metform-notify-wrap h2, .metform-notify-wrap h3, .metform-notify-wrap .mf-section-title {\n  display: none !important;\n}\n\n.metform-notify-wrap form, .metform-notify-wrap .mf-form {\n  display: flex !important;\n  flex-direction: row !important;\n  max-width: 460px !important;\n  margin: 0 auto 1rem !important;\n  align-items: stretch !important;\n  justify-content: center !important;\n}\n\n.metform-notify-wrap .mf-input-wrapper, .metform-notify-wrap form > div:not(.mf-btn-wraper) {\n  flex-grow: 1 !important;\n  width: 100% !important;\n  min-width: 0 !important;\n}\n\n.metform-notify-wrap input[type='email'], .metform-notify-wrap .mf-input {\n  width: 100% !important;\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) !important;\n  border: 0.5px solid rgba(104, 143, 157, 0.35) !important;\n  border-right: none !important;\n  color: var(--cream) !important;\n  font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif !important;\n  font-size: 0.85rem !important;\n  padding: 1rem 1.25rem !important;\n  outline: none !important;\n  transition: border-color 0.3s !important;\n  box-shadow: none !important;\n  border-radius: 0 !important;\n}\n\n.metform-notify-wrap input[type='email']::placeholder {\n  color: rgba(164, 178, 186, 0.45) !important;\n}\n\n.metform-notify-wrap input[type='email']:focus {\n  border-color: rgba(104, 143, 157, 0.65) !important;\n}\n\n.metform-notify-wrap .mf-btn-wraper, .metform-notify-wrap button {\n  flex-shrink: 0 !important;\n  margin: 0 !important;\n  padding: 0 !important;\n}\n\n.metform-notify-wrap button[type='submit'], .metform-notify-wrap .metform-btn {\n  background: var(--seafoam) !important;\n  border: 0.5px solid var(--seafoam) !important;\n  color: var(--stone) !important;\n  font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif !important;\n  font-size: 0.68rem !important;\n  font-weight: 500 !important;\n  letter-spacing: 0.2em !important;\n  text-transform: uppercase !important;\n  padding: 1rem 1.6rem !important;\n  cursor: pointer !important;\n  transition: all 0.3s !important;\n  white-space: nowrap !important;\n  min-height: auto !important;\n  line-height: normal !important;\n  border-radius: 0 !important;\n  height: auto !important;\n}\n\n.metform-notify-wrap button[type='submit']:hover, .metform-notify-wrap .metform-btn:hover {\n  background: var(--breeze) !important;\n  border-color: var(--breeze) !important;\n}\n\n.notify-section .form-note {\n  font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif !important;\n  font-size: 0.7rem !important;\n  color: rgba(164, 178, 186, 0.42) !important;\n  letter-spacing: 0.06em !important;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .notify-section { padding: 5rem 1.5rem !important; }\n  .metform-notify-wrap form, .metform-notify-wrap .mf-form {\n    flex-direction: column !important;\n  }\n  .metform-notify-wrap input[type='email'], .metform-notify-wrap .mf-input {\n    border-right: 0.5px solid rgba(104, 143, 157, 0.35) !important;\n    border-bottom: none !important;\n  }\n  .metform-notify-wrap .mf-btn-wraper, .metform-notify-wrap button {\n    width: 100% !important;\n  }\n}\n</style>"
